	IF EX:射精 + EX:MASTER:射精 >= LOCAL:5 || EX:噴乳 + EX:MASTER:噴乳 >= LOCAL:6 || EX:放尿 + EX:MASTER:放尿 >= LOCAL:7 || EX:Defecation + EX:MASTER:Defecation >= LOCAL:8
